<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Ninian and Lester half yr shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Ninian and Lester half yr shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		   57	   vs   38</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  15	   vs   10</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     2.14	vs    1.42</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     3.79	vs    2.19</p>
<p>    Tax			   1.42	vs    0.97</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     1.76	vs    1.55</p>
<p>    Turnover		  168.71	vs  145.63</p>
<p>Div payable: Sept 17</p>
<p>On register: Sept 5</p>
<p>Full name: Ninian and Lester Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - While profits for the first half year were an improvement over those for 1996, profits for the second half are expected to be similar to those achieved for the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>Accordingly, it is anticipated that profits for the year will show a modest improvement over the previous year.</p>
